    description: >
      Open-source developer dashboard that aggregates GitHub PRs, CI status,
      and deployment health into a single real-time view.
    achievements:
      - 1,200+ GitHub stars and featured in JavaScript Weekly
      - Used internally by 3 companies for engineering team standups
    technologies:
      - React
      - TypeScript
      - WebSockets
      - GitHub API

  - name: Customer Health Score System
    type: work
    description: >
      ML-powered system that predicts customer churn risk by analyzing usage
      patterns, support interactions, and billing data.
    achievements:
      - Identified 85% of at-risk accounts 30 days before churn
      - Directly contributed to $2M ARR retention in first year
    technologies:
      - Python
      - scikit-learn
      - PostgreSQL
      - Looker

  - name: API Gateway Rebuild
    type: work
    description: >
      Led initiative to replace legacy API gateway with a modern solution
      supporting rate limiting, auth, and observability out of the box.
    achievements:
      - Reduced API error rate from 2.3% to 0.1%
      - Cut infrastructure costs by 40% through right-sizing
    technologies:
      - Kong
      - Terraform
      - Datadog
      - Python

